 "quotes": [
  {
   "text": "significantly below",
   "form": "partial",
   "speaker": "e4",
   "speaker_as_printed": "Justice Palmer",
   "verb": "stated",
   "channel": "court",
   "about": [
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "a strong and legitimate public interest in publication of Mr Tamati-Te Paki's name",
   "form": "partial",
   "speaker": "e5",
   "speaker_as_printed": "Justice MacGillivray's",
   "verb": "stated",
   "channel": "court",
   "about": [
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Yes, there has been a sense of revictimisation,",
   "form": "direct",
   "speaker": "e9",
   "speaker_as_printed": "a family spokesperson",
   "verb": "told",
   "channel": "interview",
   "about": [
    "e2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "She didn't choose any of this. She continues to live with the consequences, while he has continued fighting to keep his identity secret.",
   "form": "direct",
   "speaker": "e9",
   "speaker_as_printed": "a family spokesperson",
   "verb": "told",
   "channel": "interview",
   "about": [
    "e2",
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "We believe his name should be out there. Thankfully, it is now.",
   "form": "direct",
   "speaker": "e9",
   "speaker_as_printed": "a family spokesperson",
   "verb": "told",
   "channel": "interview",
   "about": [
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "He came into her life because he was supposed to help her. Yet he came as a snake in the grass.",
   "form": "direct",
   "speaker": "e9",
   "speaker_as_printed": "The spokesperson",
   "verb": "said",
   "channel": "interview",
   "about": [
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "We don't blame all police for what one officer did ... yet one bad apple is enough to leave a sour taste.",
   "form": "direct",
   "speaker": "e9",
   "speaker_as_printed": "The spokesperson",
   "verb": "said",
   "channel": "interview",
   "about": [
    "e12",
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "At the time of this, I was already vulnerable. I was not expecting to be harmed again.",
   "form": "direct",
   "speaker": "e2",
   "speaker_as_printed": "her stepdaughter",
   "verb": "read",
   "channel": "court",
   "about": [
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "He was someone I should have been able to trust without hesitation.",
   "form": "direct",
   "speaker": "e2",
   "speaker_as_printed": "she",
   "verb": "said",
   "channel": "court",
   "about": [
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The offending was manipulative and intentional.",
   "form": "direct",
   "speaker": "e2",
   "speaker_as_printed": "she",
   "verb": "said",
   "channel": "court",
   "about": [
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "He has taken significant steps at rehabilitation, and that should give you some confidence.",
   "form": "direct",
   "speaker": "e6",
   "speaker_as_printed": "Russell Boot",
   "verb": "urged",
   "channel": "court",
   "about": [
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "the case was so unusual, she had been unable to find any other case involving a police officer as serious as this",
   "form": "indirect",
   "speaker": "e7",
   "speaker_as_printed": "Crown Solicitor Jacinda Hamilton",
   "verb": "said",
   "channel": "court",
   "about": [
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "spinning her a yarn",
   "form": "partial",
   "speaker": "e7",
   "speaker_as_printed": "She",
   "verb": "labelled",
   "channel": "court",
   "about": [
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The reference to a gambling addiction may put it into context, but there is little evidence about that,",
   "form": "direct",
   "speaker": "e7",
   "speaker_as_printed": "she",
   "verb": "said",
   "channel": "court",
   "about": [
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "clearly trusted you to do the best by her",
   "form": "partial",
   "speaker": "e3",
   "speaker_as_printed": "Judge Clark",
   "verb": "told",
   "channel": "court",
   "about": [
    "e2",
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "I have to say Mr Tamati-Te Paki, it's a really close run thing ... the circumstances are quite extraordinary,",
   "form": "direct",
   "speaker": "e3",
   "speaker_as_printed": "the judge",
   "verb": "said",
   "channel": "court",
   "about": [
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Perhaps what sways it for me is the steps that you have taken, belatedly, what is clearly a gambling addiction and the offer of reparation.",
   "form": "direct",
   "speaker": "e3",
   "speaker_as_printed": "the judge",
   "verb": "said",
   "channel": "court",
   "about": [
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "extremely disappointed",
   "form": "partial",
   "speaker": "e8",
   "speaker_as_printed": "Waikato police Superintendent Scott Gemmell",
   "verb": "told",
   "channel": "interview",
   "about": [
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "far below the standard expected of our staff",
   "form": "partial",
   "speaker": "e8",
   "speaker_as_printed": "Waikato police Superintendent Scott Gemmell",
   "verb": "told",
   "channel": "interview",
   "about": [
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "It is particularly egregious that this person targeted a vulnerable older person who rightly trusted them in their capacity as an officer.",
   "form": "direct",
   "speaker": "e8",
   "speaker_as_printed": "Waikato police Superintendent Scott Gemmell",
   "verb": "told",
   "channel": "interview",
   "about": [
    "e1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The public deserves to have trust in us, and police will not hesitate to take action any time offending like this is detected.",
   "form": "direct",
   "speaker": "e8",
   "speaker_as_printed": "Waikato police Superintendent Scott Gemmell",
   "verb": "told",
   "channel": "interview",
   "about": [
    "e12"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The community can be assured that a full investigation was undertaken and there is no further evidence to indicate any wider offending has been undertaken by this person.",
   "form": "direct",
   "speaker": "e8",
   "speaker_as_printed": "Waikato police Superintendent Scott Gemmell",
   "verb": "told",
   "channel": "interview",
   "about": [
    "e1"
   ]
  }
 ],
